"Multiple Token Mismatches" by Test

Room hall "A long hall."

on traverse passage:
    fail too_dark
    fail out_of_bounds

on enter hall:
    when {traverse passage}:
        blocked:
            say "The way is blocked."
        succeed:
            say "You pass through."
